      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Alternatively, a better option is to calculate how long the avatar's get processed by the cpu/gpu based on draw calls, the longer it takes to perform 1 subframe, the worse performance penalty gets. idealy, the calculation should be based on the lowest gpu denominator ie nvidia geforce rtx 2050 by simulation.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
